modified to achieve green. A whole-module compile with everything intact reported
errors ONLY in those pre-existing files and ZERO in any PeriodCompare* / AppRoute /
TeslaSyncApp file (grep-verified). The KMP Shared.xcframework was built fresh via
Gradle (apps/shared :core:assembleSharedXCFramework, BUILD SUCCESSFUL).

